 }
+
+// norns-js E9-249: HOME is /home/we, as on a norns. Emscripten's default is
+// /home/web_user, so `Platform.userHomeDir`, "~" and the Extensions folder
+// all pointed somewhere no norns script expects (grains keeps its SynthDef
